[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#aa76de]⚡ Why Choose Exylia Entity Limiter?[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[COLOR=#e7cfff]Tired of server lag caused by excessive entities? Exylia Entity Limiter is your ultimate solution for maintaining optimal server performance while keeping your worlds clean and lag-free.[/COLOR]

[CENTER][SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#8a51c4]✨ Key Features[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[B][COLOR=#8fffc1]⚡ Hybrid Protection System[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Reactive limiting - Prevents entity spawns when limits are reached[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Proactive cleanup - Automated periodic cleanup tasks[/COLOR]
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#8fffc1]🎯 Smart Entity Management[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Per-entity-type limits - Configure limits for each entity type[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Chunk-based system - Maximum efficiency aligned with Minecraft architecture[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Intelligent removal strategies - Choose how entities are removed (farthest, random, oldest)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#8fffc1]🛡️ Protection Features[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Bypass custom named entities - Keep your named pets safe[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Bypass villagers with professions - Protect your trading halls[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Bypass tagged entities - Use scoreboard tags for protection[/COLOR]
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#8fffc1]⚙️ Advanced Technology[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Multi-level caching with Caffeine - Lightning-fast performance[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Async-first threading - No main thread blocking[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Object pooling - Reduced garbage collection pressure[/COLOR]
