[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Clickable messages - Teleport to chunks with one click[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Pagination system - Easy navigation through data[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#e7cfff]Real-time alerts - Get notified when entities are removed[/COLOR]
[/LIST]

