[*][B][COLOR=#59a4ff]Dependencies:[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#e7cfff]None! All libraries are included[/COLOR]
[*][B][COLOR=#59a4ff]Performance:[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#e7cfff]Async-first design, minimal main thread usage[/COLOR]
